We are super excited to announce that we have a range of new classes starting this Spring. Dust the cobwebs off those Covid bodies and get out and into community, fitness and fun. We have new dundun dance in Chatsworth on Mondays, absolute beginners in Palmwoods on Wednesdays, Intermediate - Open African dance (live drumming) and African drumming in Palmwoods on Tuesdays.

**Mondays starting October 10th 5.30pm**

Chatsworth Hall - Dundun Dance with Katie

[$80 for 4 weeks + $20 drum hire](/product/dundun-dance-4-week-course-including-drum-hire/)

**Tuesdays starting October 4th 5.30pm**

Palmwoods Memorial Hall - African Drumming with Nathaniel

[$80 for 4 weeks](/product/4-class-pass-drum-dance-classes/) + [$16 drum hire](/product/drum-hire/) (never done a RC class before grab the $50 special [here](/product/come-and-play-4-class-pass-special-offer/)).

**Tuesdays starting October 4th 6.30pm**

[Palmwoods Memorial Hall](http://www.palmwoodshall.org.au/) - African dance open/intermediate class (live drumming) with Bec

[$80 for 4 weeks](/product/4-class-pass-drum-dance-classes/) (never done a RC class before grab the $50 special [here](/product/come-and-play-4-class-pass-special-offer/)).

**Wednesdays starting October 5th 6pm**

[CWA Hall in Palmwoods](https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fmaps%2Fdir%2F%3Fapi%3D1%26destination%3D-26.68629%252C152.95908%26fbclid%3DIwAR1FJD8tMLLl1aik4jmCOkb0rYvM2QNXIKoktDPYtEjsKipoJiMjrY3X7HE&h=AT3jCfvNTIUPFViFdpEMHiuHucsX3nYoKeVH4XGAz5Ld-ebY4xmdIzo3XdpGKDwQmTfUCNuEHqymx5xS9OBHJRr265GSHFKI8A3C9AHINpBot3aGvmngtw2dPpdsy2jFgLJLag) - Absolute Beginners African Dance Class with Yayoi

[$80 for 4 weeks](/product/4-class-pass-drum-dance-classes/) (never done a RC class before grab the $50 special [here](/product/come-and-play-4-class-pass-special-offer/)).

We look forward to warming up with you all!!

Bring on Summer!! ;)
